# Typography

Heading

Cormorant Garamond

Body

Inter

Never use more than two font families.

---

# Spacing

Use an 8-point spacing system.

Allowed spacing values:

4

8

12

16

24

32

40

48

64

80

96

Avoid arbitrary spacing.

---

# Border Radius

Small

8px

Medium

12px

Large

16px

Extra Large

24px

Pill

9999px

---

# Shadows

Use soft shadows only.

Avoid heavy shadows.

---

# Motion

Animations should be subtle.

Duration:

150ms

200ms

300ms

Maximum:

500ms

---

# Buttons

Primary

Brand Blue

Secondary

Outline

Ghost

Danger

Never invent new button styles.

---

# Cards

Consistent padding.

Consistent radius.

Consistent hover.

---

# Icons

Use Lucide only.

Avoid mixing icon libraries.

---

# Images

Photography should be the hero.

Never overuse illustrations.

Food photography should remain natural.

Do not oversaturate colors.

---

# Overall Rule

If a design decision is uncertain,

choose the simpler,

cleaner,

more premium solution.